.title KiCad schematic


R6 NET0001 Net-_Q3-B_ 1k
R3 VCC Net-_Q2-G_ 10k
R2 +5V NET0006 10k
R5 VCC NET0004 10k
C2 VCC 0 100n
C3 +5V 0 100n
